                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "An action keeps its name end to end: the button says Publish, the toast says Published. Ghost carries no fill of its own — it is drawn here on --bg-surface so it reads as the surface it sits on. Every one of these has a visible focus-visible ring: 2 px of --focus-ring at 2 px offset, no exceptions.",
