                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The tokens never change per surface. What changes is density and voice: the storefront gets --text-md, --space-5 and room for the image to sell; the backoffice drops to --text-sm, --space-3 and a 36 px rhythm, because a shopkeeper is scanning rather than shopping. Same component, same tokens, different step on the same scale.",
