                  "content": "This sheet is a projection of design/tokens.css, never a second copy of it. The mockup proposes, a person approves, tokens.css changes — invariant 12 applied to design instead of to the catalogue. A design artefact is disposable: it is kept as the evidence of a measurement, not maintained as a source of truth (ADR 0033).",
